\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">屋外</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">室外；户外；露天</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"97495\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>屋外<rp>(</rp><rt>おくがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>スポーツに<ruby>熱心<rp>(</rp><rt>ねっしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>である。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们热衷于户外运动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">送り仮名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おくりがな</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">送假名（汉字后所附的假名，用以补全词的读音或表示词尾变化）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おげんきで</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\"><span lang=\"en\">take care；stay well (said when parting)</span></span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">怠る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おこたる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怠慢；疏忽；懈怠；不做；未完成；避免；逃避；不留心；（疾病）好转；康复；改善</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"88619\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>職務<rp>(</rp><rt>しょくむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>怠<rp>(</r